<title>USA: IMM currency futures sag as dollar soars.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures sag as dollar soars.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 15 - IMM currencies were lower, with yen and sterling pummeled by cash options-related selling. Sept yen at lowest price since May as talks swirls a noted hedge fund massively buying deep out-of-the-money yen puts. Sept sterling slides, also amid talk of hedge fund buying sterling puts. Traders call overall futures action moderate.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
